    LLM: 'Aim for either most or least card points when everyone is under 100; avoid the middle. Ensure you win at least one trick when possible.\n\nControl when trumps are established by choosing when to void. Win early tricks to control the lead. Preserve 6s and Aces.\n\nTrack suit distribution and card points. Calculate whether to push for most or least points. In 4-player ties, understand stick-in-abeyance rules.',
